        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bali cuulu bayoocija cakuyoowa muntu omwe, muyoocija cakuyoowa bantu bosanwe buyo, mane mwasyaala mbuli kasamu kandembela amutwe wacilundu na mbuli citondezyo atala lyakalundu. ",
