              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ncobeni nubantu ba-Zioni bakede mu-Jerusalemu, tamukooyoolila limbi. Uyoomufwida luzyalo aswiilila ijwi lyakukwiila kwanu. Alimvwe buyo, uyoovuwa ndilyonya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
