          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone! Izina lya-Jehova lilazwa kule, lilapya bukali bwakwe, lili abusi buuntumuka, Milomo yakwe ilizwile bukali, alwalo lulimi lwakwe luli mbuli mulilo uutentesya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.2.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tes 2:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luyooyo lwakwe luyooba mbuli kalonga kapaya katanwa munsingo. Uyooseba bamasi mulusebo lwabuyo. Amumyeebo yabantu muyooba lumingwa lubaleesya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muyooba alwiimbo, mbubonya mbuli ciindi camasiku ipobwe nililigwa, akukondwa kwamumoyo mbubonya mbuli ciindi cakuya busiba nyeele kuya kucilundu ca-Jehova Mandomba aa-Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Jehova uyoocita kuti ijwi lyakwe lilemu limvwigwe akutondezya kuvukula kwakuboko kwakwe, abukali bwalunyemo lwakwe: amabangabanga aamulilo uutentesya, aguwo amvula impati acivulamabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo ijwi lya-Jehova ndeliti pwaye mu-Asuri iwakali kuumya bantu musako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela zyuumo zyoonse zyamusako uubikidwe Jehova nguuti muumye, ziyooba anyeele atuntimbwa, Uyoobalwida munkondo azipaizyo zivukuzidwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 7:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Tofeti wakabambwa kalekale. Wakabambilwa mwami, Wacilampya kunsi, abwaamba bwaco wabukomezya. Calundikilwa mulilo ankuni zinji loko, Luyooyo lwa-Jehova luli mbuli kalonga kasulufa, ndondulo lucikunka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
